{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38630","headline":"巫山高 · 李沇","name":"巫山高","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"抉天心，开地脉，俘动凌霄拂蓝碧。\n襄王端眸望不极，似睹瑶姬长叹息。\n巫妆不治独西望，暗泣红蕉抱云帐。\n君王妬妾梦荆宫，虚把金泥印仙掌。\n江涛迅激如相助，十二狞龙怒行雨。\n崑仑谩有通天路，九峰正在天低处。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李沇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38630.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38630","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}